  "reason": "The original candidate asserts that overfitting is characterized by memorizing dataset-specific noise. The rejection feedback (text_1) clarifies that while memorization is a hallmark, it is not strictly necessary; models can overfit via spurious correlations or poor generalization of patterns without full memorization. Therefore, the assertion 'Overfitting is characterized by the model memorizing dataset-specific noise' is too restrictive and factually incomplete as a general definition. A sound correction must broaden the characterization to include learning spurious correlations or artifacts that generalize poorly, acknowledging that memorization is one mechanism but not the only one.",
